          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ديمقراطية (dīmuqrāṭiyya) is a modern loan, usually traced to Greek dēmokratia, \"rule of the people\", through European languages. Arabic added its own abstract ending -iyya."
            }
          ]
        },
